# Retail Sales Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project analyzes retail sales data using Microsoft Excel.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- KPI Cards

## Dashboard KPIs
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Total Orders
- Profit Margin

## Key Insights
- Technology generated the highest sales and profit.
- South region recorded the highest sales.
- Phone was the best-selling product.
- July was the lowest-performing month.

